id: MOD7-4
package: fandhe-workshop-pack
test: start_unmet
target: crates/core/src/start_gate.rs
find:             Self::UnknownStart => RefuseReason::UnknownStart,
replace:             Self::UnknownStart => RefuseReason::StartUnmet,
expect-fail: mod7_unknown_start_id_is_refused_without_change
note: 存在しない開始 ID を条件の不成立と取り違える
